msgid ""
"Note, however, that special basis sets are needed for correlating inner "
"shells, and it does make not much sense to do such calculations with the "
"standard basis sets described above. The correlation-consistent core-valence"
" basis sets (cc-pCV\\ :math:`x`\\ Z where :math:`x` is D, T, Q, "
":math:`5,\\dots`) are available for this purpose."
msgstr ""
"但请注意，关联内层需要特殊的基组，使用上述标准基组进行此类计算意义不大。为此目的，可以使用相关一致芯-价基组（cc-pCV\\ :math:`x`\\ "
"Z，其中 :math:`x` 为 D、T、Q、\\ :math:`5,\\dots`\\ ）。"

