msgstr "以下是 O\\ :math:`_2` 的完整 CCSD(T) 计算示例。"

msgid "MCSCF and CASSCF calculations"
msgstr "MCSCF 和 CASSCF 计算"

msgid ""
"In the MCSCF method a multiconfiguration wavefunction is variationally "
"optimized with respect to simultaneous variations of the orbitals and "
"configuration coefficients. As explained in section `method and wavefunction"
" specification <quickstart.html#method-and-wavefunction-specification>`__, "
"the Hartree-Fock wavefunction is uniquely defined by specifying the number "
"of occupied orbitals in each symmetry and possibly the singly occupied "
"orbitals. In the MCSCF case some more information is necessary. We will "
"begin to explain the input for CASSCF (complete active space SCF), which is "
"the simplest case."
msgstr ""
"在 MCSCF 方法中，一个多组态波函数通过同时对轨道和组态系数进行变分优化。如 `method and wavefunction "
"specification <quickstart.html#method-and-wavefunction-specification>`__ "
"一节所述，Hartree-Fock 波函数通过指定每个对称性中的占据轨道数以及可能的单占据轨道来唯一定义。在 MCSCF "
"情况下，需要更多信息。我们将从解释 CASSCF（完全活性空间 SCF）的输入开始，这是最简单的情况。"

msgid "Complete Active Space Self-Consistent Field, CASSCF"
msgstr "完全活性空间自洽场，CASSCF"

msgid ""
"In a CASSCF wavefunction the occupied orbital space is divided into a set of"
" *inactive* or *closed-shell* orbitals and a set of *active* orbitals. All "
"inactive orbitals are doubly occupied in each Slater determinant. On the "
"other hand, the active orbitals have varying occupations, and all possible "
"Slater determinants (or CSFs) are taken into account which can be generated "
"by distributing the :math:`N_{act}=N_{el}-2 m_{\\text{closed}}` electrons in"
" all possible ways among the active orbitals, where "
":math:`m_{\\text{closed}}` is the number of closed-shell (inactive) "
"orbitals, and :math:`N_{el}` is the total number of electrons. Thus, it "
"corresponds to a full CI in the active space."
msgstr ""
"在 CASSCF 波函数中，占据轨道空间被划分为一组\\ *非活性*\\ 或\\ *闭壳层*\\ 轨道和一组\\ *活性*\\ "
"轨道。所有非活性轨道在每个斯莱特行列式中都是双占据的。另一方面，活性轨道具有变化的占据数，并且考虑了所有可能的斯莱特行列式（或 "
"CSF），这些行列式可以通过将 :math:`N_{act}=N_{el}-2 m_{\\text{closed}}` "
"个电子以所有可能的方式分布在活性轨道中生成，其中 :math:`m_{\\text{closed}}` 是闭壳层（非活性）轨道的数量，\\ "
":math:`N_{el}` 是电子总数。因此，它对应于活性空间中的全组态相互作用。"

msgid "The CASSCF program is invoked using the"
msgstr "CASSCF 程序通过以下命令调用"

msgid "``casscf``"
msgstr "``casscf``"

msgid ""
"Aliases for this command are ``mcscf`` or ``multi``. This command is "
"optionally followed by further input defining the wavefunction. The inactive"
" orbital space is defined using the ``closed`` directive."
msgstr ""
"此命令的别名是 ``mcscf`` 或 ``multi``\\ 。该命令后面可以跟随定义波函数的进一步输入。非活性轨道空间使用 ``closed`` "
"指令定义。"

msgid ""
"where :math:`n_i` is the number of doubly occupied (inactive) orbitals in "
"irreducible representation :math:`i`. The total number of occupied orbitals "
"is specified using the ``occ`` directive, as in Hartree-Fock."
msgstr ""
"其中 :math:`n_i` 是第 :math:`i` 个不可约表示中双占据（非活性）轨道的数量。占据轨道的总数使用 ``occ`` 指令指定，如同在 "
"Hartree-Fock 中一样。"

msgid ""
"where :math:`m_i \\ge n_i`. The number of active orbitals in irreducible "
"representations :math:`i` is then :math:`m_i - n_i`. Note that the inactive "
"orbitals are always the first in each symmetry, i.e., inactive and active "
"spaces cannot be mixed. The number of electrons, as well as the symmetry of "
"the wavefunction and the total spin is specified using the ``wf`` directive,"
" as explained already for open-shell HF:"
msgstr ""
"其中 :math:`m_i \\ge n_i`\\ 。那么第 :math:`i` 个不可约表示中的活性轨道数量为 :math:`m_i - n_i`\\"
" 。请注意，非活性轨道总是每个对称性中的前几个，即非活性空间和活性空间不能混合。电子数、波函数的对称性以及总自旋使用 ``wf`` 指令指定，正如开壳层"
" HF 中已经解释的那样："

msgid ""
