"product of the symmetries of all occupied spin orbitals), and :math:`ms2=2S`"
" defines the spin (0=singlet, 1=doublet, 2=triplet etc)."
msgstr ""
"其中 :math:`isym` 是总波函数的对称性（所有占据自旋轨道对称性的直积），而 :math:`ms2=2S` "
"定义了自旋（0=单重态，1=双重态，2=三重态等）。"

msgid "From the above it follows that the number of active electrons is"
msgstr "由上述可知，活性电子数为"

msgid "N_{act} = N_{el} - 2 \\sum_i^{m_{\\text{closed}}} n_i"
msgstr ""
"N_{act} = N_{el} - 2 \\sum_i^{m_{\\text{closed}}} n_i\n"
"\n"

msgid ""
"By default, the inactive space consists of all inner-shell orbitals, and the"
" active space of all valence orbitals which are obtained from the atomic "
"valence orbitals (full valence active space). The default number of "
"electrons equals the sum of nuclear charges, the default wavefunction "
