msgid "and now only 1408 CSFs or 4036 Slater determinants are generated."
msgstr "现在仅生成 1408 个 CSF 或 4036 个斯莱特行列式。"

msgid "Restricted Active Space self-consistent field, RASSCF"
msgstr "限制活性空间自洽场，RASSCF"

msgid ""
"Since the number of CSFs or Slater determinants and thus the computational "
"cost quickly increases with the number of active orbitals, it may be "
"desirable to use a smaller set of CSFs. One way to make a selection is to "
