"中的占据轨道数量增加到 8，并移除对轨道 6.1 的限制。"

msgid ""
"It is found that this calculation is not convergent. The reason is that some"
" orbital rotations are almost redundant with single excitations, i.e., the "
"effect of an orbital transformation between the strongly and weakly occupied"
" spaces can be expressed to second order by the single and double "
"excitations. This makes the optimization problem very ill conditioned. This "
"problem can be removed by eliminating the single excitations from / into the"
" restricted orbital space as follows:"
msgstr ""
"发现此计算不收敛。原因是某些轨道旋转几乎与单激发冗余，即，强占据空间与弱占据空间之间的轨道变换效应可以通过单双激发以二阶形式表达。这使得优化问题变得病态严重。通过如下方式消除与受限轨道空间相关的单激发可以解决此问题："

msgid "and now the calculation converges smoothly."
msgstr "现在计算顺利收敛。"

msgid ""
"Converging MCSCF calculations can sometimes be tricky and difficult. "
"Generally, CASSCF calculations are easier to converge than restricted "
"calculations, but even in CASSCF calculations problems can occur."
msgstr "收敛 MCSCF 计算有时可能很棘手且困难。通常，CASSCF 计算比受限计算更容易收敛，但即使在 CASSCF 计算中也可能出现问题。"

msgid ""
"The reasons for slow or no convergence could be one or more of the "
"following."
msgstr "收敛缓慢或不收敛的原因可能是以下一个或多个。"

msgid ""
"As a rule of thumb, it can be said that if a CASSCF calculation does not "
"converge or converges very slowly, the active or inactive space is not "
"chosen well."
msgstr "根据经验，可以说如果 CASSCF 计算不收敛或收敛非常缓慢，那么活性空间或非活性空间的选择不当。"

msgid "State-averaged MCSCF"
msgstr "态平均 MCSCF"

msgid ""
"In order to compute excited states it is usually best to optimize the energy"
" average for all states under consideration. This avoids root-flipping "
"problems during the optimization process and yields a single set of "
"compromise orbitals for all states."
msgstr "为了计算激发态，通常最好优化所有考虑态的能量平均值。这避免了优化过程中的根翻转问题，并为所有态产生一组折中的轨道。"

msgid ""
"The number of states to be optimized in a given symmetry is specified on a "
"``state`` directive, which must follow directly after the ``wf`` directive, "
"e.g.,"
msgstr "在给定对称性中要优化的态的数量在 ``state`` 指令中指定，该指令必须紧跟在 ``wf`` 指令之后，例如，"

msgid "``wf,16,1,0;state,2 !optimize two states of symmetry 1``"
msgstr "``wf,16,1,0;state,2 !optimize two states of symmetry 1``"

msgid ""
"It is also possible to optimize states of different symmetries together. In "
"this case several ``wf`` / ``state`` directives can follow each other, e.g.,"
msgstr "也可以一起优化不同对称性的态。在这种情况下，多个 ``wf`` / ``state`` 指令可以依次出现，例如，"

msgid "etc. Optionally also the weights for each state can be specified, e.g."
msgstr "等等。也可以选择性地指定每个态的权重，例如，"

msgid ""
"By default, the weights of all states are identical, which is normally the "
"most sensible choice. The following example shows a state-averaged "
"calculation for :math:`\\rm O_2`, in which the valence states "
"(:math:`^3\\Sigma_g^-`, :math:`^1\\Delta_g`) are treated together."
msgstr ""
"默认情况下，所有态的权重相同，这通常是最合理的选择。以下示例展示了对 :math:`\\rm O_2` 进行的态平均计算，其中价态 "
"(:math:`^3\\Sigma_g^-`, :math:`^1\\Delta_g`) 被一起处理。"

msgid ""
"Note that averaging of states with different spin-multiplicity, as in the "
"present examples, is possible only for CASSCF, but not for more restricted "
"RASSCF or MCSCF, wavefunctions."
msgstr "请注意，如本示例所示，对不同自旋多重度的态进行平均，仅适用于 CASSCF，而不适用于限制性更强的 RASSCF 或 MCSCF 波函数。"

msgid "MCSCF with selected configurations"
msgstr "具有选定组态的 MCSCF"

msgid ""
"MCSCF with arbitrary selected configuration spaces can also be performed. "
"The only restriction is that always all CSFs with different spin couplings "
"arising from the same orbital occupancy are included. There are two ways to "
"select configurations. Either, they are selected from a previous calculation"
" with a threshold, or they are defined explicitly in the input. Here we only"
" describe the latter case; for more details please refer to the reference "
"manual."
msgstr ""
"也可以执行具有任意选定组态空间的 MCSCF。唯一的限制是，总是包含由相同轨道占据数产生的、具有不同自旋耦合的所有 "
"CSF。有两种选择组态的方法：要么根据阈值从先前的计算中选取，要么在输入中明确定义。这里我们仅描述后一种情况；更多细节请参阅参考手册。"

msgid ""
"The configuration input starts with the ``select`` directive, and "
"subsequently each orbital configuration is given by one line starting with "
"the keyword ``con``, followed by the occupation numbers of the active "
"orbitals. The following example shows an input for formaldehyde."
msgstr ""
"组态输入以 ``select`` 指令开始，随后每个轨道组态由一行给出，该行以关键字 ``con`` "
"开头，后跟活性轨道的占据数。以下示例展示了甲醛的输入。"

msgid ""
"This calculation includes all CSFs of the CASSCF with coefficients larger "
"than 0.04."
msgstr "此计算包含了系数大于 0.04 的所有 CASSCF CSF。"

msgid "Multireference electron correlation methods"
msgstr "多参考电子相关方法"

msgid ""
"MCSCF or CASSCF calculations usually account only for a small percentage of "
"the dynamical correlation energy. Therefore, in order to obtain accurate "
"results, subsequent correlation treatments are possible. This can either be "
"done by multireference configuration interaction (MRCI) or by multireference"
" perturbation theory (MRPT). The latter is simpler and much cheaper, but "
"also less reliable than MRCI."
msgstr ""
"MCSCF 或 CASSCF "
"计算通常只考虑了动态相关能的一小部分。因此，为了获得精确的结果，可以进行后续的相关性处理。这可以通过多参考组态相互作用（MRCI）或多参考微扰理论（MRPT）来实现。后者更简单且成本低得多，但可靠性也低于"
" MRCI。"

msgid "Multireference configuration interaction (MRCI)"
msgstr "多参考组态相互作用（MRCI）"

msgid "MRCI calculations are invoked using the"
msgstr "MRCI 计算通过使用"

msgid "``mrci``"
msgstr "``mrci``"

msgid "or"
msgstr "或"

msgid "``mrcic``"
msgstr "``mrcic``"

msgid ""
"By default, the same occupied and closed-shell spaces as in the preceding "
"MCSCF (CASSCF) calculation are used, and the inner-shell *core* orbitals are"
" not correlated (i.e., the :math:`1s` orbitals of carbon or oxygen, or the "
":math:`1s`, :math:`2s`, and :math:`2p` orbitals in chlorine). The number of "
"uncorrelated core orbitals can be modified using the ``core`` directive (see"
" section `Closed-shell correlation methods <quickstart.html#closed-shell-"
"correlation-methods>`__). It is not necessary that the reference "
"wavefunction is exactly the same as in the MCSCF, and the ``occ``, "
"``closed``, ``restrict``, and ``select`` directives can be used exactly in "
"the same way as explained for MCSCF and CASSCF."
msgstr ""
"默认情况下，使用与先前 MCSCF（CASSCF）计算中相同的占据和闭壳层空间，并且内层\\ *芯*\\ 轨道不参与相关（例如，碳或氧的 "
":math:`1s` 轨道，或氯中的 :math:`1s`\\ 、\\ :math:`2s` 和 :math:`2p` "
"轨道）。未参与相关的芯轨道数量可以使用 ``core`` 指令进行修改（参见章节 `闭壳层相关方法 <quickstart.html#closed-"
"shell-correlation-methods>`__\\ ）。参考波函数不必与 MCSCF 中的完全相同，并且可以完全按照为 MCSCF 和 "
"CASSCF 解释的方式使用 ``occ``\\ 、\\ ``closed``\\ 、\\ ``restrict`` 和 ``select`` 指令。"

msgid ""
"By default, the orbitals are taken from the most recent orbital optimization"
" calculation (HF or MCSCF/CASSCF). Other orbitals can be specified using the"
" ``orbital`` directive. Please refer to the reference manual for further "
"details."
msgstr ""
"默认情况下，轨道取自最近的轨道优化计算（HF 或 MCSCF/CASSCF）。可以使用 ``orbital`` "
"指令指定其他轨道。更多详情请参阅参考手册。"

msgid ""
"The following is an example of a CASSCF/MRCI calculations for :math:`\\rm "
"O_2`."
msgstr "以下是一个针对 :math:`\\rm O_2` 的 CASSCF/MRCI 计算示例。"

msgid "Multireference perturbation theory, CASPT2, CASPT3"
msgstr "多参考微扰理论，CASPT2，CASPT3"

msgid ""
"The input for MRPT/CASPT2 is similar to MRCI, but the following commands are"
" used."
msgstr "MRPT/CASPT2 的输入与 MRCI 类似，但使用以下命令。"

msgid ""
"In case of ``rs2`` and ``rs3``, exactly the same configuration spaces as in "
"the MRCI are used. In this case the excitations with two electrons in the "
"external orbital space are *internally contracted*. The total number of "
"correlated orbitals is restricted to 16 for machines with 32-bit integers "
"and to 32 for machines with 64-bit integers."
msgstr ""
"对于 ``rs2`` 和 ``rs3``\\ ，使用与 MRCI 中完全相同的组态空间。在这种情况下，外部轨道空间中具有两个电子的激发是\\ "
"*内收缩*\\ 的。相关轨道的总数在 32 位整数机器上限制为 16，在 64 位整数机器上限制为 32。"

msgid ""
"In the ``rs2c`` case certain additional configuration classes involving "
"internal and semi-internal excitations are also internally contracted (see "
"`J. Chem. Phys. <https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.481132>`__ **112**, 5546 "
"(2000)). This is exactly as in the ``mrcic`` case (see above). This method "
"is much more efficient than ``rs2`` and more suitable for large cases. In "
"particular, in this case only the number of *active* orbitals is restricted "
"to 16 or 32 on 32 and 64 bit machines, respectively, and any number of "
"closed-shell (inactive) orbitals can be used (up to a maximum as defined by "
"a program parameter)."
msgstr ""
"在 ``rs2c`` 情况下，某些涉及内部和半内部激发的附加组态类也是内收缩的（参见 `J. Chem. Phys. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.481132>`__ **112**, 5546 (2000)）。这与 ``mrcic`` "
"情况完全相同（见上文）。此方法比 ``rs2`` 高效得多，更适用于大型计算。特别是，在这种情况下，\\ *活性*\\ 轨道的数量在 32 位和 64 "
"位机器上分别限制为 16 或 32，并且可以使用任意数量的闭壳层（非活性）轨道（最多达到程序参数定义的最大值）。"

msgid ""
"Note that the RS2 and RS2c methods yield slightly different results. In both"
" cases the results also slightly differ from those obtained with the method "
"of of Roos et al. (`J. Chem. Phys. <https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.462209>`__ "
"**96**, 1218 (1992)), as implemented in ``MOLCAS``, since in the latter case"
" *all* configuration spaces are internally contracted. This introduces some "
"bottlenecks that are not present in Molpro."
msgstr ""
"请注意，RS2 和 RS2c 方法得出的结果略有不同。在这两种情况下，结果也与 Roos 等人（\\ `J. Chem. Phys. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.462209>`__ **96**, 1218 (1992)）的方法（在 "
"``MOLCAS`` 中实现）所得结果略有差异，因为在后一种情况下，\\ *所有*\\ 组态空间都是内收缩的。这引入了一些在 Molpro "
"中不存在的瓶颈。"

msgid ""
"Restricted active space (RASPT2) or general MRPT2 calculations can be "
"performed using the ``restrict`` and/or ``select`` directives as explained "
"in section for MCSCF and CASSCF."
msgstr ""
"可以使用 ``restrict`` 和/或 ``select`` 指令执行限制活性空间（RASPT2）或通用 MRPT2 计算，如 MCSCF 和 "
"CASSCF 章节所述。"

msgid ""
"MRPT2 and CASPT2 calculations often suffer from so-called intruder state "
"problems, leading to a blow-up of the wavefunction and no convergence. This "
"problem can often be avoided by using *level shifts*. These shifts can be "
"specified on the ``rs2`` and ``rs2c`` cards:"
msgstr ""
"MRPT2 和 CASPT2 计算常常受到所谓的入侵态问题困扰，导致波函数发散且无法收敛。这个问题通常可以通过使用\\ *能级位移*\\ "
"来避免。这些位移可以在 ``rs2`` 和 ``rs2c`` 卡片上指定："

msgid ""
"The energy is approximately corrected for the shift as proposed by Roos and "
"Andersson. (`Chem. Phys. Lett. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1016/0009-2614(95)01010-7>`__ **245**, 215 (1995))."
msgstr ""
"能量会根据 Roos 和 Andersson 提出的方法对位移进行近似校正。（\\ `Chem. Phys. Lett. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1016/0009-2614(95)01010-7>`__ **245**, 215 (1995)）。"

msgid ""
"Alternatively (or in addition, the IPEA shift proposed by G. Ghigo, B. O. "
"Roos, and P.A. Malmqvist, `Chem. Phys. Lett. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1016/j.cplett.2004.08.032>`__ **396**, 142 (2004) can"
" be used:"
msgstr ""
"或者（或同时）可以使用 G. Ghigo、B. O. Roos 和 P.A. Malmqvist 提出的 IPEA 位移（\\ `Chem. Phys."
" Lett. <https://dx.doi.org/10.1016/j.cplett.2004.08.032>`__ **396**, 142 "
"(2004)）："

msgid ""
"It is also possible to use modified zeroth-order Hamiltonians; see reference"
" manual for further details."
msgstr "也可以使用修改后的零阶哈密顿量；详情请参阅参考手册。"

msgid ""
"Energy gradients are available for ``rs2``, including multi-state "
"treatments. Currently, gradients are not yet available for ``rs2c``."
msgstr "能量梯度可用于 ``rs2``\\ ，包括多态处理。目前，\\ ``rs2c`` 尚不支持梯度计算。"

msgid "Multi-state CASPT2"
msgstr "多态 CASPT2"

msgid ""
"Multi-state caspt2 calculations are only possible with the ``rs2`` program."
msgstr "多态 caspt2 计算仅能在 ``rs2`` 程序中实现。"

msgid ""
"There are various possibilities how to choose the zeroth-order Hamiltonian "
"and the configuration basis. Here we describe only the recommended method; "
"for more details see manual."
msgstr "选择零阶哈密顿量和组态基有多种可能性。此处我们仅描述推荐的方法；更多细节请参阅手册。"

msgid "Three options are relevant:"
msgstr "有三个相关选项："

msgid "where"
msgstr "其中"

msgid "Example:"
msgstr "示例："

msgid "Density functional calculations"
msgstr "密度泛函计算"

msgid ""
"Molpro is able to carry out standard Kohn-Sham DFT calculations using either"
" the spin-restricted (``ks`` or ``rks``) or spin-unrestricted (``uks``) "
"formalisms. Here is a simple example, which does a local-density "
"approximation (LDA) calculation for formaldehyde."
msgstr ""
"Molpro 能够使用自旋限制（\\ ``ks`` 或 ``rks``\\ ）或自旋非限制（\\ ``uks``\\ ）形式进行标准的 Kohn-"
"Sham DFT 计算。这里是一个简单的例子，对甲醛进行局域密度近似（LDA）计算。"

msgid ""
"The exchange-correlation functional, and associated potential, are "
"integrated numerically, and in principle it is necessary to supply "
"parameters to allow the construction of an appropriate grid. However, the "
"grid is built using a model adaptive scheme, and it is normally necessary to"
" specify only the required energy accuracy. This threshold is in turn taken "
"by default from the overall energy convergence threshold, so in most "
"calculations it is not normally necessary to specify anything at all."
msgstr ""
"交换-"
"相关泛函及其相关势是通过数值积分计算的，原则上需要提供参数以构建合适的网格。然而，网格是使用模型自适应方案构建的，通常只需要指定所需的能量精度。此阈值默认取自整体能量收敛阈值，因此在大多数计算中通常无需指定任何内容。"

msgid ""
"Many different exchange and correlation functionals are contained in the "
"program. They are implemented in a modular fashion, with both computer code "
"and documentation being built directly from their mathematical definition. "
"This means that you can always find the precise definition of a functional "
"in the user manual. Each functional has a keyword which is used to identify "
"it in the input file. The functionals to be used are given one after each "
"other as options to the ``ks`` command; for example, the following does a "
"Kohn-Sham calculation using Becke’s exchange functional, and the "
"Lee–Yang–Parr correlation functional."
msgstr ""
"程序中包含许多不同的交换与关联泛函。它们以模块化方式实现，计算机代码和文档都直接根据其数学定义构建。这意味着您始终可以在用户手册中找到泛函的精确定义。每个泛函都有一个关键字，用于在输入文件中标识它。要使用的泛函作为"
" ``ks`` 命令的选项依次给出；例如，以下命令使用 Becke 交换泛函和 Lee–Yang–Parr 相关泛函进行 Kohn-Sham 计算。"

msgid "``ks,b,lyp``"
msgstr "``ks,b,lyp``"

msgid ""
"Another commonly used combination (in fact, the default) is ``ks,s,vwn`` "
"which gives LDA (Slater–Dirac exchange, Vosko–Wilk–Nusair correlation). "
"Finally, the program is aware of some combinations of functionals, for "
"example ``ks,b3lyp`` which is the hybrid B3LYP functional consisting of "
"weighted combinations of various density functionals together with a "
"fraction of exact (Hartree–Fock) exchange."
msgstr ""
"另一个常用组合（事实上是默认组合）是 ``ks,s,vwn``\\ ，它给出 LDA（Slater-Dirac 交换，Vosko-Wilk-Nusair"
" 关联）。最后，程序识别某些泛函组合，例如 ``ks,b3lyp``\\ ，它是混合 B3LYP "
"泛函，由各种密度泛函的加权组合加上一部分精确（Hartree-Fock）交换组成。"

msgid ""
"Other options, such as the closed- and open-shell orbitals and the "
"wavefunction symmetry can be defined as explained in section `method and "
"wavefunction specification <quickstart.html#method-and-wavefunction-"
"specification>`__."
msgstr ""
"其他选项，例如闭壳层和开壳层轨道以及波函数对称性，可以按照章节 `method and wavefunction specification "
"<quickstart.html#method-and-wavefunction-specification>`__ 中的说明进行定义。"

msgid "Geometry optimization"
msgstr "几何优化"

msgid ""
"Geometry optimizations are invoked by the ``optg`` input directive, which "
"must follow the input of the method for which the optimization is to be "
"performed. For instance, optimization of the geometry for formaldehyde at "
"the MP2 level is performed with the following input"
msgstr ""
"几何优化通过 ``optg`` 输入指令调用，该指令必须跟在要进行优化的方法的输入之后。例如，在 MP2 级别对甲醛进行几何优化使用以下输入"

msgid ""
"Optimizations use analytical energy gradients if available; otherwise the "
"gradients are computed by finite differences. Presently, analytical energy "
"gradients are available for the following methods."
msgstr "优化使用解析能量梯度（如果可用）；否则通过有限差分计算梯度。目前，以下方法提供解析能量梯度。"

msgid "``hf`` Closed and open-shell spin restricted Hartree-Fock (RHF)"
msgstr "``hf`` 闭壳层和开壳层自旋限制 Hartree-Fock (RHF)"

msgid "``uhf`` Spin-unrestricted Hartree-Fock (UHF)."
msgstr "``uhf`` 自旋非限制 Hartree-Fock (UHF)。"

msgid "``ks`` Spin-restricted closed and open-shell Kohn-Sham calculations."
msgstr "``ks`` 自旋限制的闭壳层和开壳层 Kohn-Sham 计算。"

msgid "``uks`` Spin-unrestricted Kohn-Sham calculations."
msgstr "``uks`` 自旋非限制的 Kohn-Sham 计算。"

msgid "``mcscf`` MCSCF and CASSCF, including state-averaged calculations"
msgstr "``mcscf`` MCSCF 和 CASSCF，包括态平均计算"

msgid "``mp2`` closed-shell MP2"
msgstr "``mp2`` 闭壳层 MP2"

msgid "``rmp2`` open-shell RMP2"
msgstr "``rmp2`` 开壳层 RMP2"

msgid "``lmp2`` closed-shell local MP2"
msgstr "``lmp2`` 闭壳层局域 MP2"

msgid "``lrmp2`` open-shell local RMP2"
msgstr "``lrmp2`` 开壳层局域 RMP2"

msgid "``qcisd`` closed-shell quadratic configuration"
msgstr "``qcisd`` 闭壳层二次组态"

msgid ""
"``qcisd(t)`` closed-shell quadratic configuration interaction, including "
"perturbative triple-excitation contribution"
msgstr "``qcisd(t)`` 闭壳层二次组态相互作用，包含微扰三重激发贡献"

msgid "``dcsd`` distinguishable cluster with singles and double excitations"
msgstr "``dcsd`` 具有单激发和双激发的可区分簇"

msgid "``ccsd`` closed-shell singles and doubles coupled-cluster"
msgstr "``ccsd`` 闭壳层单双激发耦合簇"

msgid "``ccsd(t)`` closed-shell coupled cluster, including triple excitations"
msgstr "``ccsd(t)`` 闭壳层耦合簇，包含三重激发"

msgid ""
"``df-mp2-f12`` closed-shell MP2-F12 with density fitting (only with certain "
"options and Ansätze, see reference manual)"
msgstr "``df-mp2-f12`` 采用密度拟合的闭壳层 MP2-F12（仅适用于特定选项和拟设，请参阅参考手册）"

msgid ""
"``df-ccsd-F12`` explicitly correlated closed-shell singles and doubles "
"coupled-cluster"
msgstr "``df-ccsd-F12`` 显式相关闭壳层单双激发耦合簇"

msgid ""
"``df-ccsd(t)-F12`` explicitly correlated closed-shell coupled cluster, "
"including triple excitations"
msgstr "``df-ccsd(t)-F12`` 显式相关闭壳层耦合簇，包含三重激发"

msgid ""
"``rs2`` Second-order multireference perturbation theory, including multi-"
"state treatments"
msgstr "``rs2`` 二阶多参考微扰理论，包含多态处理"

msgid ""
"Most gradient methods are also available with density fitting, see section "
"`density fitting approximations <quickstart.html#density-fitting-"
"approximations>`__. Gradients for explicitly correlated methods are only "
"available with density fitting."
msgstr ""
"大多数梯度方法也可用于密度拟合，参见章节 `density fitting approximations "
"<quickstart.html#density-fitting-approximations>`__\\ 。显式相关方法的梯度仅适用于密度拟合。"

msgid ""
"Various options are available for modifying the convergence thresholds and "
"the optimization method. For details see the reference manual."
msgstr "有多种选项可用于修改收敛阈值和优化方法。详情请参阅参考手册。"

msgid "Frequency calculations"
msgstr "频率计算"

msgid ""
"Harmonic vibrational frequencies can be computed automatically using the "
"``frequency`` directive. Normally, this should be preceded by a geometry "
"optimization. A typical input reads as follows."
msgstr "可以使用 ``frequency`` 指令自动计算谐波振动频率。通常，这应在几何优化之后进行。典型的输入如下所示。"

msgid ""
"The second energy derivatives are computed by finite differences using "
"analytical energy gradients when available (see section `geometry "
"optimization <quickstart.html#geometry-optimization>`__), otherwise from "
"energies (which may take long time and is less accurate!). Note that during "
