msgid "Integral-direct calculations"
msgstr "积分直接计算"

msgid ""
"With the exception of perturbative triples corrections, all methods "
"implemented in Molpro can be performed in integral-direct mode, i.e., "
"without storage of the two-electron integrals on disk. Naturally, this takes"
" longer than conventional calculations, since the integrals are recomputed "
"whenever needed. The integral-direct mode is activated by giving the "
"``gdirect`` directive before the first energy calculation, e.g.,"
msgstr ""
"除了微扰三重激发校正外，Molpro "
"中实现的所有方法都可以在积分直接模式下执行，即无需将双电子积分存储在磁盘上。自然，这比传统计算耗时更长，因为积分在需要时会重新计算。积分直接模式通过在第一次能量计算之前给出"
" ``gdirect`` 指令来激活，例如，"

msgid "Density fitting approximations"
msgstr "密度拟合近似"

msgid ""
"Density fitting can be used to approximate the integrals in spin restricted "
"Hartree-Fock (``HF``), density functional theory (``KS``), second-order "
"Møller-Plesset perturbation theory (``MP2`` and ``RMP2``), explicitly "
"correlated MP2 (MP2-F12), all levels of closed-shell local correlation "
"methods (``LCC2``, ``LMP2``-``LMP4``, ``LQCISD(T)``, ``LCCSD(T)``), PNO-"
"LMP2, PNO-LCCSD(T), as well as for ``CASSCF`` and ``CASPT2`` methods. In the"
" literature the corresponding methods are often also denoted as RI-HF, RI-"
"DFT, or RI-MP2 etc. We prefer the acronym DF since RI is used for another "
"purpose in explicitly correlated methods (cf. section `explicitly correlated"
" methods <quickstart.html#explicitly-correlated-methods>`__)."
msgstr ""
"密度拟合可用于近似自旋限制 Hartree-Fock (``HF``)、密度泛函理论 (``KS``)、二阶 Møller-Plesset 微扰理论 "
"(``MP2`` 和 ``RMP2``)、显式相关 MP2 (MP2-F12)、所有级别的闭壳层局域相关方法 (``LCC2``, "
"``LMP2``-``LMP4``, ``LQCISD(T)``, ``LCCSD(T)``)、PNO-LMP2、PNO-LCCSD(T)，以及 "
"``CASSCF`` 和 ``CASPT2`` 方法中的积分。在文献中，相应的方法也常被称为 RI-HF、RI-DFT 或 RI-MP2 "
"等。我们更倾向于使用缩写 DF，因为 RI 在显式相关方法中另有用途（参见 `显式相关方法 <quickstart.html#explicitly-"
"correlated-methods>`__ 一节）。"

msgid ""
"These methods are either direct or semi-direct, i.e. only relatively small "
"sets of transformed four-index integrals are stored. They are very much "
"faster than standard direct calculations and highly recommended, in "
"particular for calculations on larger molecules. The errors caused by "
"density fitting approximations are generally negligible."
msgstr ""
"这些方法要么是直接的，要么是半直接的，即只存储相对较小的变换后的四指标积分集。它们比标准的直接计算快得多，强烈推荐使用，特别是对于较大分子的计算。由密度拟合近似引起的误差通常可以忽略不计。"

msgid ""
"Density fitting is invoked by adding the prefix ``DF-`` to the command name,"
" e.g. ``DF-HF``, ``DF-KS``, ``DF-MP2`` and so on. Gradients are available "
"for ``DF-HF``, ``DF-KS``, and ``DF-LMP2``. Symmetry is not implemented for "
"density fitting programs. Therefore, symmetry is turned off automatically if"
" DF- is found in the input."
msgstr ""
