"def2 基组，适用于大多数原子。"

msgid ""
"In density fitted local coupled cluster methods [DF-LCCSD(T)] (see section "
"`local correlation treatments <quickstart.html#local-correlation-"
"treatments>`__) there is an additional option ``df_basis_ccsd`` that may "
