msgstr ""
"在显式相关计算中可能也需要特殊的基组定义，参见章节 `显式相关方法 <quickstart.html#explicitly-correlated-"
"methods>`__\\ 。"

msgid ""
"There are many other options affecting, e.g. screening and other details, "
