"``LMP3``, ``LMP4``, ``LQCISD``, ``LCCSD``, or ``LCISD`` commands."
msgstr ""
"较旧的基于投影原子轨道的局域相关处理通过在命令名称前添加 ``L`` 来启用，即使用 ``LMP2``\\ 、\\ ``LMP3``\\ 、\\ "
"``LMP4``\\ 、\\ ``LQCISD``\\ 、\\ ``LCCSD`` 或 ``LCISD`` 命令。"

msgid ""
"The ``LQCISD`` and ``LCCSD`` commands can be appended by a specification for"
