"(e.g., domains and pair classes). Here we only described the most important "
"ones. For a full description please read the Molpro users manual."
msgstr "有许多选项和指令可用于控制局域近似（例如，域和对儿类别）。此处我们仅描述最重要的部分。完整描述请阅读 Molpro 用户手册。"

msgid "Orbital localization"
msgstr "轨道定域化"

msgid ""
"By default, the orbitals are localized using the method of Pipek and Mezey "
"(PM). Alternatively, natural localized molecular orbitals (NLMOs) can be "
"used [see `Mol. Phys. <https://dx.doi.org/10.1080/00268970701628209>`__ "
"**105**, 2753 (2007)] by specifying the option ``LOC_METHOD=NLMO``. Note "
"that analytical energy gradients can be computed only with PM orbitals."
msgstr ""
"默认情况下，轨道使用 Pipek 和 Mezey (PM) 的方法进行定域化。或者，可以通过指定选项 ``LOC_METHOD=NLMO`` "
"来使用自然定域分子轨道 (NLMO) [参见 `Mol. Phys. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1080/00268970701628209>`__ **105**, 2753 "
"(2007)]。请注意，解析能量梯度只能使用 PM 轨道计算。"

msgid "Choice of domains"
msgstr "域的选择"

msgid ""
"The following applies to the PAO-LMP2 and PAO-LCCSD methods. In case of the "
"new OSV-LMP2 and OSV-LCCSD(T) methods the standard domains only affect the "
"pair approximations. See section `OSV calculations <quickstart.html#osv-"
"calculations>`__ for more details."
msgstr ""
"以下内容适用于 PAO-LMP2 和 PAO-LCCSD 方法。对于新的 OSV-LMP2 和 OSV-LCCSD(T) "
"方法，标准域仅影响对近似。更多细节请参见 `OSV 计算 <quickstart.html#osv-calculations>`__ 一节。"

msgid "Standard domains"
msgstr "标准域"

msgid ""
"Standard domains are always determined first. They are used to define "
"strong, close, weak, and distant pairs. More accurate results can be "
"obtained with extended domains (see section `extended domains "
"<quickstart.html#extended-domains>`__), but these extensions do not affect "
"the pair classification."
msgstr ""
"标准域总是首先确定。它们用于定义强对、近对、弱对和远对。使用扩展域可以获得更精确的结果（参见 `扩展域 "
"<quickstart.html#extended-domains>`__ 一节），但这些扩展不影响对儿类别。"

msgid ""
"The domains can be determined either by the method of Boughton and Pulay "
"(BP) [J. Comp. Chem. **14**, 736 (1993)] or using natural population "
"analysis (NPA) as described in `Mol. Phys. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1080/00268970701628209>`__ **105**, 2753 (2007). By "
"default, the BP method is used with PM orbitals, while NPA method is "
"employed with NLMOs. This default behaviour can be superceded using "
"``THRBP``\\ =\\ *value* (use the BP method with the given threshold) or "
"``NPASEL=``\\ *value* (use the NPA method with the given threshold)."
msgstr ""
"域可以通过 Boughton 和 Pulay (BP) 的方法 [J. Comp. Chem. **14**, 736 (1993)] "
"或使用自然布居分析 (NPA) 来确定，如 `Mol. Phys. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1080/00268970701628209>`__ **105**, 2753 (2007) "
"中所述。默认情况下，BP 方法与 PM 轨道一起使用，而 NPA 方法与 NLMO 一起使用。可以使用 ``THRBP``\\ =\\ *值*\\ "
"（使用具有给定阈值的 BP 方法）或 ``NPASEL=``\\ *值*\\ （使用具有给定阈值的 NPA 方法）来覆盖此默认行为。"

msgid ""
"This BP method is somewhat basis set dependent and therefore the default "
"value of ``THRBP`` depends on the basis set: 0.980 for AVDZ, 0.985 for AVTZ,"
" and 0.990 for AVQZ. The NPA method is much less basis set dependent and the"
" default value is ``NPASEL=0.03``."
msgstr ""
"这种 BP 方法在一定程度上依赖于基组，因此 ``THRBP`` 的默认值取决于基组：AVDZ 为 0.980，AVTZ 为 0.985，AVQZ 为 "
"0.990。NPA 方法对基组的依赖性要小得多，默认值为 ``NPASEL=0.03``\\ 。"

msgid "Extended domains"
msgstr "扩展域"

msgid ""
"In order to increase the accuracy various options can be used to extend the "
"domains (for details see Molpro manual). But note that the computational "
"effort increases with the fourth power of the domain sizes and can therefore"
" increase quite dramatically when extending domains. This does not affect "
"the linear scaling behaviour in the asymptotic limit."
msgstr ""
"为了提高精度，可以使用各种选项来扩展域（详情请参阅 Molpro "
"手册）。但请注意，计算量随域大小的四次方增加，因此在扩展域时计算量可能会急剧增加。这不会影响渐近极限下的线性标度行为。"

msgid "OSV calculations"
msgstr "OSV 计算"

msgid ""
"Orbital specific virtuals are used if the option ``osvsel`` is given, e.g."
msgstr "如果指定了选项 ``osvsel``\\ ，则会使用轨道特定虚轨道，例如。"

msgid "``df-lccsd(t),throsv=1.d-4``"
msgstr "``df-lccsd(t),throsv=1.d-4``"

msgid "Choice of pair classes"
msgstr "对儿类别的选择"

msgid ""
"The *strong*, *close*, *weak* and *distant* pairs are selected using "
"distance or connectivity criteria as described in more detail in section "
"`options for selection of pair classes <quickstart.html#options-for-"
"selection-of-pair-classes>`__. *Strong* pairs are treated by CCSD, all other"
" pairs by LMP2. However, if option ``keepcls=1`` is ised, the LMP2 close "
"pair amplitudes are included in the LCCSD amplitude equations for the strong"
" pairs. This is recommended (and default) for OSV and F12 calculations. In "
"triples calculations, all orbital triples :math:`(ijk)` are included for "
"which :math:`(ij)`, :math:`(ik)`, and :math:`(jk)` are *close pairs*. In "
"addition, one of these pairs is restricted to be strong. The triples energy "
"depends on the strong and close pair amplitudes. Thus, increasing the "
"distance or connectivity criteria for close and weak pairs will lead to more"
" accurate triples energies (and also to more accurate LCCSD energies if "
"``keepcsl=1`` is used). While for near equilibrium properties like "
"geometries and harmonic vibrational frequencies the default values are "
"normally appropriate, larger distance criteria are sometimes needed when "
"computing energy differences, in particular barrier heights. In cases of "
"doubt, ``RWEAK`` should first be increased until convergence is reached, and"
" then ``RCLOSE`` can be varied as well. Such tests can be performed with "
"small basis sets like cc-pVDZ, and the optimized values then be used in the "
"final calculations with large basis sets."
msgstr ""
"*强*\\ 对、\\ *近*\\ 对、\\ *弱*\\ 对和\\ *远*\\ 对是使用距离或连通性标准选择的，更详细的描述见章节 `options "
"for selection of pair classes <quickstart.html#options-for-selection-of-"
"pair-classes>`__\\ 。\\ *强*\\ 对由 CCSD 处理，所有其他对由 LMP2 处理。但是，如果使用了选项 "
"``keepcls=1``\\ ，则 LMP2 近对振幅会被包含在强对的 LCCSD 振幅方程中。这对于 OSV 和 F12 "
"计算是推荐（且默认）的。在三重激发计算中，所有满足 :math:`(ij)`\\ 、\\ :math:`(ik)` 和 :math:`(jk)` "
"都是\\ *近对*\\ 的轨道三重激发 :math:`(ijk)` "
"都会被包含。此外，这些对中的一个被限制为强对。三重激发能取决于强对和近对的振幅。因此，增加近对和弱对的距离或连通性标准将导致更精确的三重激发能（如果使用了"
" ``keepcsl=1``\\ ，也会得到更精确的 LCCSD "
"能量）。虽然对于近平衡性质（如几何结构和简谐振动频率），默认值通常是合适的，但在计算能量差（特别是势垒高度）时，有时需要更大的距离标准。如有疑问，应首先增加"
" ``RWEAK`` 直到达到收敛，然后也可以调整 ``RCLOSE``\\ 。此类测试可以使用小基组（如 cc-"
"pVDZ）进行，然后将优化后的值用于最终的大基组计算。"

msgid ""
"Pair approximations only affect the LCCSD calculations (LMP2 is only "
"affected by ``verydist``). The defaults for ``IWEAK``, ``ICLOSE``, and "
"``KEEPCLS`` are wck=2,1,0, respectively, for PAO-LCCSD, and 3,2,1 for OSV-"
"LCCSD and all F12 methods."
msgstr ""
"对近似仅影响LCCSD计算（LMP2仅受\\ ``verydist``\\ 影响）。对于PAO-LCCSD，\\ ``IWEAK``\\ 、\\ "
"``ICLOSE``\\ 和\\ ``KEEPCLS``\\ 的默认值分别为wck=2,1,0；对于OSV-"
"LCCSD和所有F12方法，默认值为3,2,1。"

msgid "Options for selection of pair classes"
msgstr "对儿类别的选择选项"

msgid ""
"There are two alternative modes for defining the pair classes: either "
"*distance criteria* ``RCLOSE``, ``RWEAK``, ``RDIST``, ``RVDIST`` can be "
"used. These are in Bohr and refer for a given orbital pair :math:`(ij)` to "
"the minimum distance :math:`R^{(ij)}` between any atom in the standard "
"orbital domains :math:`[i]` and any atom in the standard orbital domains "
":math:`[j]` . Alternatively, the *connectivity criteria* ``ICLOSE``, "
"``IWEAK``, ``IDIST``, ``IVDIST`` can be used. These refer to the minimum "
"number of bonds between any atom contained in the standard domain "
":math:`[i]` and any atom contained in the standard domain :math:`[j]` The "
"advantage of using connectivity criteria is the independence of the bond "
"lengths, while the advantage of distance criteria (default) is that they are"
" also effective in non-bonding situations. Only one of the two possibilities"
" can be used, i.e., they are mutually exclusive (except that ``RDIST`` and "
"``RVDIST`` can be combined with ``ICLOSE,IWEAK``). The use of distance "
"criteria is the default. Using connectivity criteria for pair selection "
"requires to set the option ``USE_DIST=0``. ``USE_DIST=0`` is automatically "
"implied if and connectivity criterion is explicitly defined."
msgstr ""
"定义对儿类别有两种替代模式：可以使用\\ *距离判据* ``RCLOSE``\\ 、\\ ``RWEAK``\\ 、\\ ``RDIST``\\ 、\\"
" ``RVDIST``\\ 。这些值以玻尔为单位，对于给定的轨道对 :math:`(ij)`\\ ，指的是标准轨道域 :math:`[i]` "
"中任意原子与标准轨道域 :math:`[j]` 中任意原子之间的最小距离 :math:`R^{(ij)}`\\ 。或者，可以使用\\ *连通性判据* "
"``ICLOSE``\\ 、\\ ``IWEAK``\\ 、\\ ``IDIST``\\ 、\\ ``IVDIST``\\ 。这些指的是标准域 "
":math:`[i]` 中包含的任意原子与标准域 :math:`[j]` "
"中包含的任意原子之间的最小键数。使用连通性判据的优点是与键长无关，而使用距离判据（默认）的优点是在非成键情况下也有效。两种可能性只能使用一种，即它们是互斥的（除了\\"
" ``RDIST``\\ 和\\ ``RVDIST``\\ 可以与\\ ``ICLOSE,IWEAK``\\ "
"组合使用）。默认使用距离判据。使用连通性判据进行对儿选择需要设置选项\\ ``USE_DIST=0``\\ 。如果显式定义了连通性判据，则自动隐含\\ "
"``USE_DIST=0``\\ 。"

msgid ""
"``RCLOSE`` (default 1) Strong pairs are defined by :math:`0 \\le R^{(ij)} "
"\\lt {\\tt RCLOSE}`. Close pairs are defined by :math:`{\\tt RCLOSE} \\le "
"R^{(ij)} \\lt {\\tt RWEAK}`."
msgstr ""
"``RCLOSE``\\ （默认值 1）强对由 :math:`0 \\le R^{(ij)} \\lt {\\tt RCLOSE}` 定义。近对由 "
":math:`{\\tt RCLOSE} \\le R^{(ij)} \\lt {\\tt RWEAK}` 定义。"

msgid ""
"``RWEAK`` (default 3) Weak pairs are defined by :math:`{\\tt RWEAK} \\le "
"R^{(ij)} \\lt {\\tt RDIST}`."
msgstr "``RWEAK``\\ （默认值 3）弱对由 :math:`{\\tt RWEAK} \\le R^{(ij)} \\lt {\\tt RDIST}` 定义。"

msgid ""
"``RDIST`` (default 8) Distant pairs are defined by :math:`{\\tt RDIST} \\le "
"R^{(ij)} \\lt {\\tt RVDIST}`."
msgstr ""
"``RDIST``\\ （默认值 8）远对由 :math:`{\\tt RDIST} \\le R^{(ij)} \\lt {\\tt RVDIST}`"
" 定义。"

msgid ""
"``RVDIST`` (default 15) Very distant pairs for which :math:`R^{(ij)} \\ge`\\"
" ``RVDIST`` are neglected."
msgstr "``RVDIST``\\ （默认值 15）对于满足 :math:`R^{(ij)} \\ge`\\ ``RVDIST`` 的极远对，将被忽略。"

msgid ""
"``ICLOSE`` (default 1) Strong pairs are separated by less that ``ICLOSE`` "
"bonds. Close orbital pairs are separated by at least ``ICLOSE`` bonds but "
"less than ``IWEAK`` bonds."
msgstr ""
"``ICLOSE``\\ （默认值 1）强对由少于\\ ``ICLOSE``\\ 个键分隔。近轨道对由至少\\ ``ICLOSE``\\ 个键但少于\\"
" ``IWEAK``\\ 个键分隔。"

msgid ""
"``IWEAK`` (default 2) Weak orbital pairs are separated by at least ``IWEAK``"
" bonds but less than ``IDIST`` bonds."
msgstr "``IWEAK``\\ （默认值 2）弱轨道对由至少 ``IWEAK`` 个键分隔，但少于 ``IDIST`` 个键。"

msgid ""
"``IDIST`` (default 5) Distant orbital pairs are separated by at least "
"``IDIST`` bonds but less than ``IVDIST`` bonds."
msgstr "``IDIST``\\ （默认值 5）远距离轨道对由至少 ``IDIST`` 个键分隔，但少于 ``IVDIST`` 个键。"

msgid ""
"``IVDIST`` (default 8) Very distant orbital pairs (neglected) are separated "
"by at least ``IVDIST`` bonds."
msgstr "``IVDIST``\\ （默认值 8）非常远的轨道对（被忽略）由至少 ``IVDIST`` 个键分隔。"

msgid ""
"Setting a distance criterion to zero means that all pairs up to the "
"corresponding class are treated as strong pairs. For instance, ``RCLOSE``\\ "
"=0 means that strong and close pairs are fully included in the LCCSD."
msgstr ""
"将距离判据设置为零意味着直到对应类别的所有对都被视为强对。例如，\\ ``RCLOSE``\\ =0 意味着强对和近对被完全包含在 LCCSD 中。"

msgid "Doing it right"
msgstr "正确操作"

msgid ""
"Here we summarize only a few important aspects. Further information and "
"hints can be found in the Molpro users manual."
msgstr "这里我们仅总结几个重要方面。更多信息和提示可以在 Molpro 用户手册中找到。"

msgid "Basis sets"
msgstr "基组"

msgid ""
"For local calculations we recommend the use of generally contracted basis "
"sets, e.g., the correlation consistent cc-pVnZ sets of Dunning and "
"coworkers. For these basis sets the core basis functions are uniquely "
"defined, and will always be eliminated if the defaults are used."
msgstr ""
"对于局域计算，我们推荐使用广义收缩基组，例如 Dunning 及其同事的相关一致 cc-pVnZ "
"基组。对于这些基组，核心基函数是唯一定义的，并且如果使用默认设置，它们总是会被消除。"

msgid ""
"The correlation consistent basis sets are also recommended for all density "
"fitting and explicitly correlated calculations, since optimized fitting and "
"RI basis sets are available for each basis."
msgstr "对于所有密度拟合和显式相关计算，也推荐使用相关一致基组，因为每个基组都有优化的拟合基组和 RI 基组可用。"

msgid "Symmetry and Orientation"
msgstr "对称性与取向"

msgid ""
"In local calculation, the use of symmetry should be disabled (option "
"``NOSYM``), since otherwise orbital localization is not possible. We also "
"recommend to use the ``NOORIENT`` option to avoid unintended rotations of "
"the molecule when the geometry changes. This is particularly important for "
"geometry optimizations and for domain restarts in calculations of "
"interaction energies. The ``NOSYM`` and ``NOORIENT`` option can be given on "
"a ``SYMMETRY`` directive that must precede the geometry block, e.g.,"
msgstr ""
"在局域计算中，应禁用对称性（选项 ``NOSYM``\\ ），否则轨道定域化将无法进行。我们还建议使用 ``NOORIENT`` "
"选项，以避免分子在几何结构变化时发生意外的旋转。这对于几何优化以及相互作用能计算中的域重启尤为重要。\\ ``NOSYM`` 和 "
"``NOORIENT`` 选项可以在 ``SYMMETRY`` 指令中给出，该指令必须位于几何结构块之前，例如，"

msgid "Localization"
msgstr "定域化"

msgid ""
"By default, Pipek-Mezey (PM) localization is used and performed "
"automatically in the beginning of a local correlation calculation. As "
"mentioned in section `orbital localization <quickstart.html#orbital-"
"localization>`__, it is also possible to use natural localized orbitals "
"(NLMOs)."
msgstr ""
"默认情况下，使用 Pipek-Mezey (PM) 定域化，并在局域相关计算开始时自动执行。如 `轨道定域化 "
"<quickstart.html#orbital-localization>`__ 一节所述，也可以使用自然定域轨道 (NLMOs)。"

msgid ""
"Poor localization is sometimes an intrinsic problem, in particular for "
"strongly conjugated systems or when diffuse basis sets are used. This is "
"caused by localization tails due to the overlapping diffuse functions. The "
"NLMO method is less susceptible to such problems than the PM method. With PM"
" localization problems are particularly frequent in calculations of systems "
"with short bonds, e.g., aromatic molecules. Often such problems can be "
"avoided using the option ``PMDEL=``\\ :math:`n` with :math:`n=1` or "
":math:`2`. This means that the contributions of the :math:`n` most diffuse "
"basis functions of each angular momentum type are ignored in the "
"localization. This often yields much better localized orbitals when diffuse "
"basis sets are used. For aug-cc-pVTZ, :math:`n=2` has been found to work "
"very well, while for aug-cc-pVDZ :math:`n`\\ =1"
msgstr ""
"定域化效果不佳有时是一个固有问题，特别是在强共轭体系或使用弥散基组时。这是由于重叠的弥散函数导致的定域化拖尾造成的。NLMO 方法比 PM "
"方法更不易受此类问题影响。使用 PM 定域化时，问题在短键体系（例如芳香族分子）的计算中尤其常见。通常，使用选项 ``PMDEL=``\\ "
":math:`n` 并设置 :math:`n=1` 或 :math:`2` 可以避免此类问题。这意味着在定域化过程中忽略每个角动量类型中 "
":math:`n` 个最弥散的基函数的贡献。在使用弥散基组时，这通常能产生定域性好得多的轨道。对于 aug-cc-pVTZ，已发现 "
":math:`n=2` 效果很好，而对于 aug-cc-pVDZ，\\ :math:`n`\\ =1"

msgid "Orbital domains"
msgstr "轨道域"

msgid ""
"In most cases, the domain selection (cf. section `choice of domains "
"<quickstart.html#choice-of-domains>`__ is uncritical for saturated "
"molecules. Nevertheless, in particular for delocalized systems, it is "
"recommended always to check the orbital domains, which are printed in the "
"beginning of each local calculation. The orbital domains consist of all "
"basis functions for a subset of atoms. These atoms are selected so that the "
"domain spans the corresponding localized orbital with a preset accuracy "
"(alterable with option ``THRBP``). A typical domain output, here for water, "
"looks like this:"
msgstr ""
"在大多数情况下，对于饱和分子，域选择（参见 `域的选择 <quickstart.html#choice-of-domains>`__ "
"一节）并不关键。然而，特别是对于离域体系，建议始终检查轨道域，这些轨道域在每个局域计算开始时打印。轨道域由原子子集的所有基函数组成。选择这些原子是为了使该域能以预设的精度（可通过选项"
" ``THRBP`` 更改）张成相应的定域轨道。一个典型的域输出（此处以水分子为例）如下所示："

msgid ""
"This tells you that the domains for orbitals 2.1 and 5.1 comprise the basis "
"functions of the oxygen atom and and one hydrogen atom, while the domains "
"for orbitals 3.1 and 4.1 consist of the basis function on oxygen only. The "
"latter ones correspond to the oxygen lone pairs, the former to the two OH "
"bonds, and so this is exactly what one would expect. For each domain of AOs,"
" corresponding projected atomic orbitals (PAOs) are generated, which span "
"subspaces of the virtual space and into which excitations are made. Options "
"which affect the domain selection are described in section `choice of "
"domains <quickstart.html#choice-of-domains>`__. Improper domains can result "
"from poorly localized orbitals (see section `localization "
"<quickstart.html#localization>`__ or a forgotten ``NOSYM`` directive. This "
"does not only negatively affect performance and memory requirements, but can"
" also lead to unexpected results."
msgstr ""
"这表明轨道 2.1 和 5.1 的域包含氧原子和一个氢原子的基函数，而轨道 3.1 和 4.1 "
"的域仅由氧原子上的基函数组成。后者对应于氧的孤对电子，前者对应于两个 O-H "
"键，因此这完全符合预期。对于每个原子轨道域，会生成相应的投影原子轨道，它们张成虚空间的子空间，激发即发生到这些子空间中。影响域选择的选项在章节 "
"`choice of domains <quickstart.html#choice-of-domains>`__ "
"中描述。不恰当的域可能源于定域化不佳的轨道（参见章节 `localization <quickstart.html#localization>`__\\"
" ）或遗漏的 ``NOSYM`` 指令。这不仅会对性能和内存需求产生负面影响，还可能导致意外的结果。"

msgid ""
"The choice of domains usually has only a weak effect on near-equilibrium "
"properties like equilibrium geometries and harmonic vibrational frequencies."
" More critical are energy differences like reaction energies or barrier "
"heights. In cases where the electronic structure strongly changes, e.g., "
"when the number of double bonds changes, it is recommended to compare DF-"
"LMP2 and DF-MP2 results before performing expensive LCCSD(T) calculations."
msgstr ""
"域的选择通常对近平衡性质（如平衡几何结构和简谐振动频率）影响微弱。更为关键的是能量差，如反应能或势垒高度。在电子结构发生强烈变化的情况下（例如，双键数量发生变化时），建议在进行昂贵的"
" LCCSD(T) 计算之前，先比较 DF-LMP2 和 DF-MP2 的结果。"

msgid "Explicitly correlated methods"
msgstr "显式相关方法"

msgid ""
"Explicitly correlated calculations provide a dramatic improvement of the "
"basis set convergence of MP2 and CCSD correlation energies. Such "
"calculations can be performed using the commands of the form"
msgstr "显式相关计算极大地改善了 MP2 和 CCSD 相关能的基组收敛性。此类计算可以使用以下形式的命令执行："

msgid "*command*, *options*"
msgstr "*command*, *options*"

msgid "where *command* can be one of the following:"
msgstr "其中 *command* 可以是以下之一："

msgid ""
"**DF-MP2-F12** As MP2-F12, but the DF-MP2 correlation energy is used. This "
"is less expensive than MP2-F12 since the standard two-electron integrals and"
" the non-density fitted MP2 energy need not to be computed."
msgstr ""
"**DF-MP2-F12** 与 MP2-F12 类似，但使用 DF-MP2 相关能。由于无需计算标准双电子积分和非密度拟合的 MP2 能量，因此比 "
"MP2-F12 计算成本更低。"

msgid ""
"**DF-RMP2-F12** Spin-restricted open-shell DF-RMP2-F12 as described in `J. "
"Chem. Phys. <https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.2889388>`__ **128**, 154103 (2008)"
" By default, ansatz 3C(FIX) is used, but ansatz 3C(D) can also be used (cf. "
"sections `wave function Ansätze <quickstart.html#wave-function-ans-tze>`__)."
msgstr ""
"**DF-RMP2-F12** 自旋限制开壳层 DF-RMP2-F12，如 `J. Chem. Phys. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.2889388>`__ **128**, 154103 (2008) 所述。默认使用拟设 "
"3C(FIX)，但也可使用拟设 3C(D)（参见章节 `wave function Ansätze <quickstart.html#wave-"
"function-ans-tze>`__\\ ）。"

msgid ""
"**CCSD-F12** Closed-shell CCSD-F12 approximations as described in `J. Chem. "
"Phys. <https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.2817618>`__ **127**, 221106 (2007) and "
"`J. Chem. Phys. <https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.3054300>`__ **130**, 054104 "
"(2009). By default, the fixed amplitude ansatz 3C(FIX) is used and the "
"CCSD-F12a and CCSD-F12b energies are computed. Optionally, the command can "
"be appended by A or B, and then only the corresponding energy is computed. "
"For more details see section `CCSD(T)-F12 <quickstart.html#ccsd-t-f12>`__."
msgstr ""
"**CCSD-F12** 闭壳层 CCSD-F12 近似，如 `J. Chem. Phys. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.2817618>`__ **127**, 221106 (2007) 和 `J. Chem."
" Phys. <https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.3054300>`__ **130**, 054104 (2009) "
"所述。默认使用固定振幅拟设 3C(FIX)，并计算 CCSD-F12a 和 CCSD-F12b 能量。可选地，命令后可附加 A 或 "
"B，则仅计算相应的能量。更多细节请参见章节 `CCSD(T)-F12 <quickstart.html#ccsd-t-f12>`__\\ 。"

msgid "**CCSD(T)-F12** Same as CCSD-F12, but perturbative triples are added."
msgstr "**CCSD(T)-F12** 与 CCSD-F12 相同，但添加了微扰三重激发。"

msgid ""
"**UCCSD-F12** Open-shell unrestricted UCCSD-F12 approximations as described "
"in `J. Chem. Phys. <https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.3054300>`__ **130**, 054104"
" (2009). Restricted open-shell Hartree-Fock (RHF) orbitals are used. "
"Optionally, the command can be appended by A or B, and then only the "
"corresponding energy is computed."
msgstr ""
"**UCCSD-F12** 开壳层非限制性 UCCSD-F12 近似，如 `J. Chem. Phys. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.3054300>`__ **130**, 054104 (2009) 所述。使用限制性开壳层"
" Hartree-Fock (RHF) 轨道。可选地，命令后可附加 A 或 B，则仅计算相应的能量。"

msgid ""
"**UCCSD(T)-F12** Same as UCCSD-F12, but perturbative triples are added."
msgstr "**UCCSD(T)-F12** 与 UCCSD-F12 相同，但添加了微扰三重激发。"

msgid "Options"
msgstr "选项"

msgid ""
"There are many options available for explicitly correlated methods, but "
"sensible defaults are used for all of them. For details see the Molpro "
"reference manual. The most important options are:"
msgstr "显式相关方法有许多可用选项，但所有选项均使用合理的默认值。详情请参阅 Molpro 参考手册。最重要的选项包括："

msgid ""
"``DF_BASIS=basis`` Select the basis for density fitting (see section "
"`density fitting approximations <quickstart.html#density-fitting-"
"approximations>`__ for details). *basis* can either refer to a set name "
"defined in the basis block, or to a default MP2 fitting basis (e.g., "
"``DF_BASIS=VTZ`` generates the ``VTZ/MP2FIT`` basis). By default, the MP2FIT"
" basis that corresponds to the orbital basis is used."
msgstr ""
"``DF_BASIS=basis`` 选择用于密度拟合的基组（详情参见 `密度拟合近似 <quickstart.html#density-"
"fitting-approximations>`__ 章节）。\\ *basis* 可以指代在基组块中定义的集合名称，或默认的 MP2 "
"拟合基组（例如，\\ ``DF_BASIS=VTZ`` 会生成 ``VTZ/MP2FIT`` 基组）。默认情况下，使用与轨道基组对应的 MP2FIT "
"基组。"

msgid ""
"``RI_BASIS=basis`` Select the basis for the resolution of the identity (RI)."
" By default the JKFIT basis that corresponds to the chosen orbital basis is "
"used. In conjunction with the VnZ-F12 basis sets, it is recommended to use "
"the VnZ-F12/OPTRI sets of Yousaf and Peterson, J. Chem. Phys. **129**, 18410"
" (2008)."
msgstr ""
"``RI_BASIS=basis`` 选择用于分辨率恒等（RI）的基组。默认使用与所选轨道基组对应的 JKFIT 基组。结合 VnZ-F12 "
"基组使用时，推荐使用 Yousaf 和 Peterson 的 VnZ-F12/OPTRI 集合，J. Chem. Phys. **129**, "
"18410 (2008)。"

msgid "Reference functions"
msgstr "参考函数"

msgid ""
"The MP2-F12, CCSD-F12, and UCCSD-F12 methods must use conventional (non-"
"density fitted) spin-restricted Hartree-Fock reference functions (HF or "
"RHF). DF-HF cannot be used for these methods. This restriction is necessary "
"to ensure that the Fock matrix is diagonal and consistent with the integrals"
" used in these methods. For DF-MP2-F12, DF-LMP2-F12, and DF-RMP2-F12 either "
"HF or DF-HF reference functions can be used."
msgstr ""
"MP2-F12、CCSD-F12 和 UCCSD-F12 方法必须使用传统的（非密度拟合）自旋限制 Hartree-Fock 参考函数（HF 或 "
"RHF）。这些方法不能使用 DF-HF。此限制对于确保 Fock 矩阵是对角的，并与这些方法中使用的积分保持一致是必要的。对于 DF-"
"MP2-F12、DF-LMP2-F12 和 DF-RMP2-F12，可以使用 HF 或 DF-HF 参考函数。"

msgid "Wave function Ansätze"
msgstr "波函数拟设"

msgid ""
"The so called ”ansatz” determines the definition of the explicitly "
"correlated wave function. This is to be distinguished from the various "
"approximations that can be used to approximate the Hamiltonian matrix "
"elements. For details see `J. Chem. Phys. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.2712434>`__ **126**, 164102 (2007). In MOLPRO "
"the following wave function ansätze can be used (specified using option "
"``ansatz``) on the command line, even though the defaults it is recommended "
"to use the defaults:"
msgstr ""
"所谓的“拟设”决定了显式相关波函数的定义。这应与用于近似哈密顿矩阵元的各种近似方法区分开来。详情请参阅 `J. Chem. Phys. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.2712434>`__ **126**, 164102 (2007)。在 MOLPRO "
"中，可以使用以下波函数拟设（通过命令行选项 ``ansatz`` 指定），尽管默认情况下建议使用默认值："

msgid "The general ansatz (ansatz=3C(FULL))"
msgstr "通用拟设 (ansatz=3C(FULL))"

msgid ""
"The conventional external pair functions are augmented by terms of the form"
msgstr "传统的对函数通过以下形式的项进行扩充"

msgid ""
"|u_{ijp}^{\\rm F12}\\rangle =  \\sum_{p=\\pm 1} \\sum_{kl} T^{ijp}_{kl} "
"\\hat Q_{12} \\hat F_{12} |kl\\rangle \\label{quickeq:uij}"
msgstr ""
"|u_{ijp}^{\\rm F12}\\rangle =  \\sum_{p=\\pm 1} \\sum_{kl} T^{ijp}_{kl} \\hat Q_{12} \\hat F_{12} |kl\\rangle \\label{quickeq:uij}\n"
"\n"

msgid ""
"This ansatz is orbital invariant (i.e., the same results are obtained with "
"canonical or localized orbitals), but it often suffers from geminal basis "
"set superposition errors. Furthermore, singularities may occur in the "
"zeroth-order Hamiltonian, in particular for larger systems. Therefore, this "
"ansatz is normally not recommended."
msgstr ""
"\\ "
"此拟设具有轨道不变性（即使用正则轨道或定域轨道会得到相同结果），但它常常受到双电子基组叠加误差的影响。此外，在零阶哈密顿量中可能出现奇点，对于较大体系尤其如此。因此，通常不推荐使用此拟设。"

msgid "The diagonal ansatz (ansatz=3C(D)"
msgstr "对角拟设 (ansatz=3C(D)"

msgid "The fixed amplitude ansatz (ansatz=3C(FIX)"
msgstr "固定振幅拟设（ansatz=3C(FIX)"

msgid ""
"The wave function has the same form as for the diagonal ansatz, but the "
"amplitudes are determined from the cusp conditions and fixed, i.e., "
":math:`T^{ij,1}_{ij}=1/2` for singlet pairs (:math:`p=1`) and "
":math:`T^{ij,-1}_{ij}=1/4` for triplet pairs (:math:`p=-1`). This restores "
"the orbital invariance, and usually the results are almost as accurate as "
"with the diagonal ansatz. This method is size consistent for any choice of "
"orbitals. Since the (T) correction in CCSD(T)-F12 calculations requires the "
"use of canonical orbitals, the FIX approximation is used by default in "
"CCSD-F12 and CCSD(T)-F12 calculations."
msgstr ""
"波函数的形式与对角拟设相同，但振幅由电子关联条件确定并固定，即对于单重态对（\\ :math:`p=1`\\ ），\\ "
":math:`T^{ij,1}_{ij}=1/2`\\ ；对于三重态对（\\ :math:`p=-1`\\ ），\\ "
":math:`T^{ij,-1}_{ij}=1/4`\\ "
"。这恢复了轨道不变性，并且通常其结果与对角拟设几乎一样精确。该方法对于任何轨道选择都是大小一致的。由于CCSD(T)-F12计算中的(T)校正需要使用正则轨道，因此在CCSD-F12和CCSD(T)-F12计算中默认使用FIX近似。"

msgid "The correlation factor F12"
msgstr "相关因子F12"

msgid ""
"In the F12 methods, the correlation factor :math:`\\hat F_{12}` is "
"approximated by a frozen expansion of Gaussian type geminals that are "
"functions of the interelectronic distance :math:`r_{12}`. In principle, this"
" can be any function, but normally a Slater function"
msgstr ""
"在F12方法中，相关因子 :math:`\\hat F_{12}` 通过一个冻结的高斯型双电子函数展开来近似，这些函数是电子间距离 "
":math:`r_{12}` 的函数。原则上，这可以是任何函数，但通常使用Slater函数"

msgid "F_{12}(r_{12})=-\\beta^{-1}\\exp(-\\beta r_{12})"
msgstr ""
"F_{12}(r_{12})=-\\beta^{-1}\\exp(-\\beta r_{12})\n"
"\n"

msgid ""
"is used. By default this function is approximated by an expansion of six "
"Gaussian functions, and the exponents and coefficients are optimized to "
"obtain the best least squares fit, using a suitable weight function. The "
"exponent :math:`\\beta` can be chosen using the option ``gem_beta=``\\ "
"*value* (default ``gem_beta=1.0``)."
msgstr ""
"\\ 被使用。默认情况下，该函数通过六个高斯函数的展开式来近似，并且指数和系数经过优化以获得最佳的最小二乘拟合，使用一个合适的权重函数。指数 "
":math:`\\beta` 可以通过选项 ``gem_beta=``\\ *值* 来选择（默认 ``gem_beta=1.0``\\ ）。"

msgid ""
"It is also possible to use geminals with different exponents for core-core "
"and core-valence calculation [see `Mol. Phys. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1080/00268976.2010.526641>`__ **109**, 407 (2011)] In"
" this case the exponents are specified as"
msgstr ""
"对于核-核和核-价计算，也可以使用具有不同指数的双子函数 [参见 `Mol. Phys. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1080/00268976.2010.526641>`__ **109**, 407 "
"(2011)]。在这种情况下，指数被指定为"

msgid ""
"The smallest :math:`\\beta` value is used for valence correlation, the "
"second-smallest for core-valence and the largest for core-core pairs. If "
"only 2 values are given, core-core and core-valence pairs are treated with "
"the same exponent. Note that the ``core`` directive is usually needed to "
"include correlation of inner-shell orbitals."
msgstr ""
"最小的 :math:`\\beta` 值用于价层相关，第二小的用于核-价相关，最大的用于核-核对。如果只给出2个值，则核-核和核-"
"价对使用相同的指数。请注意，通常需要 ``core`` 指令来包含内壳层轨道的相关。"

msgid ""
"In addition, also linear R12-methods (:math:`F_{12}=r_{12}`) are available "
"(DF-MP2-R12 and DF-LMP2-R12). However, these are no longer recommended since"
" the non-linear correlation factor yields much better accuracy, numerical "
"stability and convergence with respect to the AO, DF and RI basis sets."
msgstr ""
"此外，线性 R12 方法 (:math:`F_{12}=r_{12}`) 也是可用的（DF-MP2-R12 和 DF-"
"LMP2-R12）。然而，这些方法不再被推荐，因为非线性相关因子在精度、数值稳定性以及对 AO、DF 和 RI 基组的收敛性方面提供了更好的结果。"

msgid ""
"In MOLPRO the F12 integrals can only be computed using density fitting (DF) "
"approximations. The many electron integrals are approximated by resolutions "
"of the identity (RI) expansions. Thus, F12 calculations require three "
"different basis sets: the orbital (AO) basis, the DF basis, and the RI "
"basis."
msgstr ""
"在 MOLPRO 中，F12 积分只能使用密度拟合（DF）近似来计算。多电子积分通过分辨率恒等（RI）展开来近似。因此，F12 "
"计算需要三种不同的基组：轨道（AO）基组、DF 基组和 RI 基组。"

msgid ""
"We recommend as AO basis sets the augmented correlation consistent basis "
"sets (denoted AVnZ) or the specially optimized correlation consistent F12 "
"basis sets (denoted VnZ-F12, cf. K.A. Peterson, T.B. Adler, and H.-J. "
"Werner, `J. Chem. Phys. <https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.2831537>`__ **128**, "
"084102 (2008)). Normally, triples zeta basis sets (AVTZ or VTZ-F12) yield "
"excellent results that are close to the basis set limit. Diffuse basis "
"functions are rather essential both for the HF and MP2-F12 energies, and "
"therefore the standard VTZ sets are not recommended. If the AVnZ or VnZ-F12 "
"orbital basis sets are used, suitable density fitting (DF) basis and "
"resolution of the identity (RI) basis sets are automatically chosen. For the"
" AV\\ :math:`nZ` basis sets, the AVnZ/MP2FIT and VnZ/JKFIT basis sets are "
"used for the DF and RI, respectively. For the V\\ :math:`n`\\ Z-F12 orbital "
"basis sets, the corresponding ``OPTRI`` CABS basis sets are used by default."
" Other basis sets can be chosen using the ``DF_BASIS`` and ``RI_BASIS`` "
"options (cf. section `options <quickstart.html#options>`__). See section "
"`density fitting approximations <quickstart.html#density-fitting-"
"approximations>`__ for more details about density fitting."
msgstr ""
"我们推荐使用增强的相关一致基组（表示为 AVnZ）或专门优化的相关一致 F12 基组（表示为 VnZ-F12，参见 K.A. Peterson, "
"T.B. Adler, and H.-J. Werner, `J. Chem. Phys. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.2831537>`__ **128**, 084102 (2008)）作为 AO "
"基组。通常，三重 zeta 基组（AVTZ 或 VTZ-F12）能产生接近基组极限的优异结果。弥散基函数对于 HF 和 MP2-F12 "
"能量都相当重要，因此不推荐使用标准的 VTZ 基组。如果使用 AVnZ 或 VnZ-F12 "
"轨道基组，则会自动选择合适的密度拟合（DF）基组和分辨率恒等（RI）基组。对于 AV\\ :math:`nZ` 基组，分别使用 AVnZ/MP2FIT "
"和 VnZ/JKFIT 基组作为 DF 和 RI 基组。对于 V\\ :math:`n`\\ Z-F12 轨道基组，默认使用相应的 ``OPTRI`` "
"CABS 基组。其他基组可以通过 ``DF_BASIS`` 和 ``RI_BASIS`` 选项来选择（参见 `options "
"<quickstart.html#options>`__ 节）。有关密度拟合的更多细节，请参见 `density fitting "
"approximations <quickstart.html#density-fitting-approximations>`__ 节。"

msgid ""
"The following example shows a ccsd(t)-f12 calculation using the VTZ-F12 "
"basis of Peterson et al., `J. Chem. Phys. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.2831537>`__ **128**, 084102 (2008), along with"
" the associated RI basis set of Yousaf and Peterson, J. Chem. Phys. **129**,"
" 18410 (2008):"
msgstr ""
"以下示例展示了使用 Peterson 等人的 VTZ-F12 基组（\\ `J. Chem. Phys. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.2831537>`__ **128**, 084102 (2008)）以及 Yousaf 和"
" Peterson 的相关 RI 基组（J. Chem. Phys. **129**, 18410 (2008)）进行的 ccsd(t)-f12 计算："

msgid ""
"The given RI and DF basis sets would also be used by default. With the AVTZ "
"orbital basis the input would read"
msgstr "给定的 RI 和 DF 基组默认也会被使用。若使用 AVTZ 轨道基组，输入将如下所示："

msgid ""
"In this case the default would be (for historical reasons and backward "
"compatibility)"
msgstr "在这种情况下，默认设置将是（出于历史原因和向后兼容性）"

msgid "Symmetry"
msgstr "对称性"

msgid ""
"Symmetry cannot be used in the local DF-LMP2-F12 and DF-LCCSD(T)-F12 "
"calculations. However, in canonical MP2-F12, DF-MP2-F12, DF-RMP2-F12, "
"CCSD(T)-F12 and UCCSD(T)-F12 calculations Abelian symmetry can be used as "
"usual; in these cases the preceding DF-MP2-F12 calculations will be "
"automatically performed without symmetry, and the integrals that are "
"necessary for subsequent CCSD-F12 or UCCSD-F12 calculations will be "
"transformed to the symmetry adapted basis. This is fully automatic and "
"transparent to the user. Note, however, that the prefix DF- turns off "
"symmetry automatically, and if you want to use symmetry in the HF "
"calculations preceding the DF-MP2-F12 or DF-MP2-F12 calculations the "
"symmetry elements (or ``AUTO``) must be specified either in the geometry "
"block, or on a ``SYMMETRY`` directive preceding the geometry block."
msgstr ""
"在局域 DF-LMP2-F12 和 DF-LCCSD(T)-F12 计算中无法使用对称性。然而，在正则 MP2-F12、DF-MP2-F12、DF-"
"RMP2-F12、CCSD(T)-F12 和 UCCSD(T)-F12 计算中，阿贝尔对称性可以照常使用；在这些情况下，前置的 DF-MP2-F12 "
"计算将自动在不使用对称性的情况下执行，并且后续 CCSD-F12 或 UCCSD-F12 "
"计算所需的积分将被变换到对称性适配基组中。这对用户来说是完全自动且透明的。但请注意，前缀 DF- 会自动关闭对称性，如果您希望在 DF-MP2-F12 "
"或 DF-MP2-F12 计算之前的 HF 计算中使用对称性，则必须在几何结构块中或在几何结构块之前的 ``SYMMETRY`` 指令中指定对称元素（或"
" ``AUTO``\\ ）。"

msgid "CABS Singles correction"
msgstr "CABS 单激发修正"

msgid ""
"By default, the perturbative CABS singles correction as described in `J. "
"Chem. Phys. <https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.2817618>`__ **127**, 221106 (2007)"
" and `J. Chem. Phys. <https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.2889388>`__ **128**, "
"154103 (2008) is included in the reference energy of all MP2-F12 and "
"CCSD-F12 calculations (now also in all local F12 calculations). The "
"corrected reference energy is stored in variable ``ENERGR``, so that "
"``ENERGY-ENERGR`` are the total correlation energies."
msgstr ""
"默认情况下，所有 MP2-F12 和 CCSD-F12 计算（现在也包括所有局域 F12 计算）的参考能量中都包含了如 `J. Chem. Phys. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.2817618>`__ **127**, 221106 (2007) 和 `J. Chem."
" Phys. <https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.2889388>`__ **128**, 154103 (2008) "
"中所述的微扰 CABS 单激发修正。修正后的参考能量存储在变量 ``ENERGR`` 中，因此 ``ENERGY-ENERGR`` 即为总相关能。"

msgid "The singles correction can be turned off by option ``SINGLES=0``, e.g."
msgstr "单激发修正可以通过选项 ``SINGLES=0`` 关闭，例如"

msgid "``MP2-F12,CABS_SINGLES=0``"
msgstr "``MP2-F12,CABS_SINGLES=0``"

msgid ""
"The contribution of core orbitals to the singles energy is not included by "
"default, but can be turned on by option ``CORE_SINGLES``, e.g."
msgstr "默认情况下，芯轨道对单激发能的贡献未被包含，但可以通过选项 ``CORE_SINGLES`` 开启，例如："

msgid "``MP2-F12,CORE_SINGLES=1``"
msgstr "``MP2-F12,CORE_SINGLES=1``"

msgid "CCSD(T)-F12"
msgstr "CCSD(T)-F12"

msgid ""
"The CCSD-F12 and UCCSD-F12 programs first do DF-MP2-F12/3C(FIX) (closed-"
"shell) or DF-RMP2-F12/3C(FIX) (open-shell) calculations, and then perform "
"the CCSD-F12 (UCCSD-F12) without density fitting. By default, the CCSD-F12a "
"and CCSD-F12b energies are both computed. A specific method can be requested"
" by appending A or B to the -F12 suffix. Furthermore, instead of the 3C(FIX)"
" ansatz, different ansätze (e.g. 3C) can be used. In this case the "
"amplitudes of the explicitly correlated terms are determined in the MP2-F12 "
"calculation and kept fixed in the CCSD-F12."
msgstr ""
"CCSD-F12 和 UCCSD-F12 程序首先进行 DF-MP2-F12/3C(FIX)（闭壳层）或 DF-"
"RMP2-F12/3C(FIX)（开壳层）计算，然后执行无密度拟合的 CCSD-F12（UCCSD-F12）计算。默认情况下，会同时计算 "
"CCSD-F12a 和 CCSD-F12b 的能量。可以通过在 -F12 后缀后附加 A 或 B 来请求特定方法。此外，可以使用不同的拟设（例如 "
"3C）来代替 3C(FIX) 拟设。在这种情况下，显式相关项的振幅在 MP2-F12 计算中确定，并在 CCSD-F12 中保持固定。"

msgid ""
"It should be noted that these methods involve approximations and do not "
"yield the exact CCSD-F12 energies. Extensive benchmarks have shown that the "
"CCSD-F12a method slightly overestimates the correlation energies, while "
"CCSD-F12b underestimates them. For AVDZ or AVTZ basis sets, CCSD-F12a "
"usually gives very good results, but for larger basis sets it may "
"overestimate the basis set limit and converge from below to the limit. Thus,"
" convergence may not be monotonic, and extrapolation of the correlation "
"energies should not be attempted. CCSD-F12b usually converges monotonically "
"from below to the limit and gives best results for AVQZ and larger basis "
"sets. Thus, we currently recommend CCSD-F12a for AVDZ and AVTZ basis sets, "
"and CCSD-F12b for larger basis sets (rarely needed)."
msgstr ""
"需要注意的是，这些方法涉及近似，不会产生精确的 CCSD-F12 能量。广泛的基准测试表明，CCSD-F12a 方法会略微高估相关能，而 "
"CCSD-F12b 则会低估相关能。对于 AVDZ 或 AVTZ 基组，CCSD-F12a "
"通常能给出非常好的结果，但对于更大的基组，它可能会高估基组极限并从下方收敛到该极限。因此，收敛可能不是单调的，不应尝试对相关能进行外推。CCSD-F12b"
" 通常从下方单调收敛到极限，并为 AVQZ 及更大的基组提供最佳结果。因此，我们目前推荐对 AVDZ 和 AVTZ 基组使用 "
"CCSD-F12a，对更大的基组（很少需要）使用 CCSD-F12b。"

msgid ""
"The perturbative triples correction can be invoked by using CCSD(T)-F12 or "
"UCCSD(T)-F12. There is no direct F12 correction to the triples, and "
"therefore the basis set error of the triples is not affected by the F12 "
"(small changes of the triples energy arise from the fact that the doubles "
"amplitudes are affected by the F12 terms). In many cases, a simple and "
"pragmatic improvement of the triples energy can be obtained by scaling the "
"triples energy contribution as"
msgstr ""
"可以通过使用 CCSD(T)-F12 或 UCCSD(T)-F12 来调用微扰三重激发校正。三重激发没有直接的 F12 校正，因此三重激发的基组误差不受"
" F12 影响（三重激发能的微小变化源于双激发振幅受到 F12 "
"项的影响）。在许多情况下，可以通过按比例缩放三重激发能贡献来获得三重激发能的简单且实用的改进，如下所示："

msgid "\\Delta E_{(T*)} = \\Delta E_{(T)}*E_{corr}^{MP2-F12}/E_{corr}^{MP2}"
msgstr ""
"\\Delta E_{(T\\ *)} = \\Delta E_{(T)}*\\ E_{corr}^{MP2-F12}/E_{corr}^{MP2}\n"
"\n"

msgid ""
"This can be done automatically by setting option ``SCALE_TRIP=1``, i.e."
msgstr "\\ 这可以通过设置选项 ``SCALE_TRIP=1`` 自动完成，即"

msgid "``CCSD(T)-F12,SCALE_TRIP=1``"
msgstr "``CCSD(T)-F12,SCALE_TRIP=1``"

msgid "Advanced features of Molpro"
msgstr "Molpro 的高级功能"

msgid ""
"In the following sections, examples for some more special capabilities of "
"Molpro are given. This description is not exhaustive. For more complete "
"information, please refer to the reference manual."
msgstr "以下章节将举例说明 Molpro 的一些更特殊的功能。此描述并非详尽无遗。如需更完整的信息，请参阅参考手册。"

msgid "Memory control"
msgstr "内存控制"

msgid ""
"Molpro stores all internal data in a single big working area, which is "
"allocated dynamically in the beginning of the calculation. The default "
"amount of memory is 8 MW (64 Mb). For big calculations more memory may be "
"needed, and the default can then be modified using the ``memory`` directive."
" This should be the first command in the input (after the ``**`` title card,"
" if present, as shown in the following example."
msgstr ""
"Molpro 将所有内部数据存储在一个单一的大型工作区中，该工作区在计算开始时动态分配。默认内存量为 8 MW（64 "
"MB）。对于大型计算，可能需要更多内存，此时可以使用 ``memory`` 指令修改默认值。这应该是输入中的第一条命令（在 ``**`` "
"标题卡之后，如果存在的话），如下例所示。"

msgid ""
"The amount of memory needed depends on the size of the molecule, the basis "
"set, the symmetry of the molecule, and the methods used, and therefore it is"
" difficult to predict it in advance. Most calculation run with 16 MW or "
"less, but in big cases with low symmetry more may be required. A rather safe"
" choice is to specify 64 MW, but of course this requires that your machine "
"has sufficient memory (in this case more than 512 MB). The memory can also "
"be given using the ``-m`` option on the ``molpro`` command line, see section"
" `how to run {Molpro} <quickstart.html#how-to-run-molpro>`__. It a "
"``memory`` card is given, it has preference over the command line option."
msgstr ""
"所需内存量取决于分子大小、基组、分子的对称性以及所使用的方法，因此很难提前预测。大多数计算在 16 MW "
"或更少内存下运行，但在对称性较低的大型计算中可能需要更多。一个相当安全的选择是指定 64 MW，但这当然要求您的机器有足够的内存（在这种情况下超过 "
"512 MB）。内存也可以通过 ``molpro`` 命令行上的 ``-m`` 选项指定，请参阅 `如何运行 {Molpro} "
"<quickstart.html#how-to-run-molpro>`__ 一节。如果给出了 ``memory`` 卡，则其优先级高于命令行选项。"

msgid "Restarting calculations"
msgstr "重启计算"

msgid ""
"By default, and in all examples shown so far, scratch files are used to "
"store all intermediate data Molpro needs, and the user will normally not see"
" these files at all. However, it is possible to save computed data as "
"orbitals and energies in named (permanent) files and use these for "
"restarting a calculation at a later stage. Molpro uses a number of different"
" files, but only one or two of them are needed for a restart. File 1 holds "
"the one- and two electron integrals and related information, while on file 2"
" the wavefunction information like orbitals, orbital energies, and "
"optionally CI-vectors are stored. Thus, file 2 is essential for restarting a"
" calculation, while the integrals on file 1 can either be restarted or "
"recomputed."
msgstr ""
"默认情况下，以及到目前为止展示的所有示例中，Molpro "
"使用临时文件存储所有所需的中间数据，用户通常完全看不到这些文件。然而，可以将计算数据（如轨道和能量）保存到命名的（永久性）文件中，并在后续阶段用于重启计算。Molpro"
" 使用多个不同的文件，但重启时只需要其中一两个。文件 1 保存单电子和双电子积分及相关信息，而文件 2 则存储波函数信息，如轨道、轨道能量以及可选的 "
"CI 向量。因此，文件 2 对于重启计算至关重要，而文件 1 上的积分既可以重启使用，也可以重新计算。"

msgid ""
"The use of named files can be requested using the ``file`` directive, which "
"should be given immediately after the ``memory`` command (if present), e.g.,"
msgstr "可以通过使用 ``file`` 指令来请求使用命名文件，该指令应紧接在 ``memory`` 命令（如果存在）之后给出，例如，"

msgid ""
"If the same files are used in a subsequent calculation, Molpro will "
"automatically recover all data saved on the given files. For instance, if "
"the following input is used after the previous example, the integrals and "
"orbitals will be restarted and used for the subsequent casscf and MRCI "
"calculations:"
msgstr ""
"如果在后续计算中使用相同的文件，Molpro "
"将自动恢复保存在给定文件上的所有数据。例如，如果在之前的示例之后使用以下输入，积分和轨道将被重启并用于后续的 casscf 和 MRCI 计算："

msgid ""
"If only file 2 is defined in the input, the integrals will automatically be "
"recomputed, as in the following input. Note that in most cases, file 1 can "
"be very large (it contains the two-electron integrals), and the cost of "
"recomputing the integrals can be a small fraction of the overall time; it is"
" therefore usually sensible in this way to avoid declaring the file as "
"permanent."
msgstr ""
"如果输入中只定义了文件 2，积分将自动重新计算，如下面的输入所示。请注意，在大多数情况下，文件 1 "
"可能非常大（它包含双电子积分），重新计算积分的成本可能只占总时间的一小部分；因此，通常明智的做法是通过这种方式避免将文件声明为永久性文件。"

msgid ""
"The automatic restart mechanism can be disabled by specifying ``new`` after "
"the filename(s), e.g.,"
msgstr "可以通过在文件名后指定 ``new`` 来禁用自动重启机制，例如，"

msgid ""
"Note that if permanent files are used, it is important to take care that two"
" simultaneous jobs do not attempt to use the same file!"
msgstr "请注意，如果使用永久性文件，务必注意不要让两个同时运行的作业尝试使用同一个文件！"

msgid ""
"Results and other values can be stored in variables for use at a later stage"
" of the calculations. Variables can simply be set in the input as"
msgstr "结果和其他值可以存储在变量中，供计算的后阶段使用。变量可以在输入中简单地设置为"

msgid "``name=value``"
msgstr "``name=value``"

msgid ""
"Variables can also be one-dimensional arrays, in which case the format is"
msgstr "变量也可以是一维数组，此时格式为"

msgid "``name=[value1,value2,value3,...]``"
msgstr "``name=[value1,value2,value3,...]``"

msgid "The current dimension of such an array is ``#name``."
msgstr "此类数组的当前维度为 ``#name``\\ 。"

msgid ""
"Molpro stores certain results in variables with predefined names. The most "
"important ones are"
msgstr "Molpro 会将某些结果存储在具有预定义名称的变量中。其中最重要的有"

msgid "``ORBITAL`` Record in which last computed orbitals are stored"
msgstr "``ORBITAL`` 存储最后计算的轨道的记录"

msgid ""
"``ENERGR(istate)`` Reference energy for state *istate* in MRCI and CCSD."
msgstr "``ENERGR(istate)`` 状态 *istate* 在 MRCI 和 CCSD 中的参考能量。"

msgid "``ENERGY(istate)`` last computed total energy for state *istate*."
msgstr "``ENERGY(istate)`` 状态 *istate* 最后计算的总能量。"

msgid ""
"``EMP2`` holds MP2 energy in MPn, CCSD, BCCD, or QCISD calculations, and RS2"
" energy in MRPT2 (CASPT2) calculations."
msgstr ""
"``EMP2`` 在 MPn、CCSD、BCCD 或 QCISD 计算中保存 MP2 能量，在 MRPT2 (CASPT2) 计算中保存 RS2 能量。"

msgid ""
"``EMP3`` holds MP3 energy in MP3 and MP4 calculations, and RS3 energy in "
"MRPT3 (CASPT3) calculations."
msgstr "``EMP3`` 在 MP3 和 MP4 计算中保存 MP3 能量，在 MRPT3 (CASPT3) 计算中保存 RS3 能量。"

msgid ""
"``EMP4`` holds MP4(SDQ) energy in MP4 calculations. The total MP4(SDTQ) "
"energy is stored in variable ``ENERGY``."
msgstr "``EMP4`` 在 MP4 计算中保存 MP4(SDQ) 能量。总的 MP4(SDTQ) 能量存储在变量 ``ENERGY`` 中。"

msgid ""
"``ZPE`` Zero-point energy in cm\\ :math:`^{-1}`, set by the ``FREQUENCIES`` "
"program."
msgstr "``ZPE`` 零点能，单位为 cm\\ :math:`^{-1}`\\ ，由 ``FREQUENCIES`` 程序设置。"

msgid ""
"``HTOTAL`` Total enthalpy at normal conditions (in a.u.), set by the "
"``FREQUENCIES`` program. This includes the zero-point energy."
msgstr "``HTOTAL`` 标准条件下的总焓（以 a.u. 为单位），由 ``FREQUENCIES`` 程序设置。此项包含零点能。"

msgid ""
"``GTOTAL`` Total free energy at normal conditions (in a.u.), set by the "
"``FREQUENCIES`` program. This includes the zero-point energy."
msgstr "``GTOTAL`` 标准条件下的总自由能（以 a.u. 为单位），由 ``FREQUENCIES`` 程序设置。此项包含零点能。"

msgid "``DMX,DMY,DMZ`` Dipole moments (when computed)."
msgstr "``DMX,DMY,DMZ`` 偶极矩（当计算时）。"

msgid ""
"``STATUS`` status of last step (1=no error, -1=error or no convergence)"
msgstr "``STATUS`` 最后一步的状态（1=无错误，-1=错误或未收敛）"

msgid "Variables in CCSD(T)-F12 and LCCSD(T)-F12 calculations:"
msgstr "CCSD(T)-F12 和 LCCSD(T)-F12 计算中的变量："

msgid "``ENERGC(1)`` LCCSD-F12a energy"
msgstr "``ENERGC(1)`` LCCSD-F12a 能量"

msgid "``ENERGC(2)`` LCCSD-F12b energy"
msgstr "``ENERGC(2)`` LCCSD-F12b 能量"

msgid "``ENERGY(1)`` LCCSD(T)-F12a energy"
msgstr "``ENERGY(1)`` LCCSD(T)-F12a 能量"

msgid "``ENERGY(2)`` LCCSD(T)-F12b energy"
msgstr "``ENERGY(2)`` LCCSD(T)-F12b 能量"

msgid ""
"``EF12`` F12 contribution to energy MP2-F12. In CCSD(T)-F12 and LCCSD(T)-F12"
" calculations the MP2-F12 energy can be obtained as ``EMP2+EF12``."
msgstr ""
"``EF12`` MP2-F12 能量的 F12 贡献。在 CCSD(T)-F12 和 LCCSD(T)-F12 计算中，MP2-F12 能量可通过 "
"``EMP2+EF12`` 获得。"

msgid ""
"Variables for unit conversions. Multiplying a variable in atomic units by "
"these variables yields:"
msgstr "用于单位转换的变量。将原子单位中的变量乘以这些变量可得到："

msgid "See reference manual for further variables."
msgstr "更多变量请参阅参考手册。"

msgid "Print options"
msgstr "打印选项"

msgid ""
"Molpro has very many print options as described in detail in the reference "
"manual for the various methods, but in practice only a few of them are "
"needed. In general, there are two kinds of print options: either global "
"ones, specified with the ``gprint`` directive, being used by all methods, or"
" local ones, given on ``print`` directives, being used only in one job step."
" The local print commands are part of the input for a specific method and "
"must therefore directly follow the corresponding command. On the other hand,"
" global print options act on all subsequent methods. For example"
msgstr ""
"Molpro 拥有非常多的打印选项，如参考手册中针对各种方法的详细描述，但在实践中只需要用到其中少数几个。通常，打印选项分为两种：一种是全局选项，通过 "
"``gprint`` 指令指定，被所有方法使用；另一种是局部选项，在 ``print`` "
"指令中给出，仅在一个作业步骤中使用。局部打印命令是特定方法输入的一部分，因此必须紧跟在相应的命令之后。另一方面，全局打印选项作用于所有后续方法。例如"

msgid ""
"To avoid confusion and unexpected results, we recommend to use global print "
"options only, except for special debugging purposes. The most important "
"global print options are"
msgstr "为避免混淆和意外结果，我们建议仅使用全局打印选项，除非用于特殊的调试目的。最重要的全局打印选项包括"

msgid ""
"Note that by default only CI coefficients larger than 0.05 are printed. See "
"section `convergence thresholds <quickstart.html#convergence-thresholds>`__ "
"for modifying this threshold."
msgstr ""
"请注意，默认情况下仅打印大于 0.05 的 CI 系数。有关修改此阈值的说明，请参阅 `收敛阈值 "
"<quickstart.html#convergence-thresholds>`__ 一节。"

msgid "``gprint,basis,orbitals=1,civector``"
msgstr "``gprint,basis,orbitals=1,civector``"

msgid "Convergence thresholds"
msgstr "收敛阈值"

msgid ""
"As for the print options, there are global and local thresholds, specified "
"using the ``gthresh`` and ``thresh`` directives, respectively. Here we only "
"mention some useful global thresholds (default values are shown)."
msgstr ""
"与打印选项类似，阈值也分为全局和局部两种，分别通过 ``gthresh`` 和 ``thresh`` "
"指令指定。这里我们仅提及一些有用的全局阈值（默认值已显示）。"

msgid ""
"Note that the energy threshold also affects the defaults for some other "
"thresholds such as ``orbital``, ``step``, and ``civec``, and therefore it is"
" normally sufficient to lower the energy threshold if high accuracy is "
"needed."
msgstr ""
"请注意，能量阈值也会影响其他一些阈值（如 ``orbital``\\ 、\\ ``step`` 和 ``civec``\\ "
"）的默认值，因此，如果需要高精度，通常只需降低能量阈值即可。"

msgid ""
"Any number of thresholds can be specified on a single ``gthresh`` directive,"
" e.g.,"
msgstr "可以在单个 ``gthresh`` 指令中指定任意数量的阈值，例如，"

msgid "``gthresh,energy=1.d-8,printci=0.03``"
msgstr "``gthresh,energy=1.d-8,printci=0.03``"

msgid "Program control using do loops, if blocks and goto commands"
msgstr "使用 DO 循环、IF 块和 GOTO 命令进行程序控制"

