msgid "Basis set extrapolation"
msgstr "基组外推"

msgid ""
"Basis set extrapolation can be carried out for correlation consistent basis "
"sets using"
msgstr "对于相关一致基组，可以使用以下命令进行基组外推"

msgid "``EXTRAPOLATE,BASIS=basislist,options``"
msgstr "``EXTRAPOLATE,BASIS=basislist,options``"

msgid ""
"where basislist is a list of at least two basis sets separated by colons, "
"e.g. AVTZ:AVQZ:AV5Z. Some extrapolation types need three or more basis sets,"
" others only two. The default is to use :math:`n^{-3}` extrapolation of the "
"correlation energies, and in this case two subsequent basis sets and the "
"corresponding energies are needed. The default is not to extrapolate the "
"reference (HF) energies; the value obtained with the largest basis set is "
"taken as reference energy for the CBS estimate. However, extrapolation of "
"the reference is also possible by specifying the ``METHOD_R`` option."
msgstr ""
"其中 basislist 是由冒号分隔的至少两个基组的列表，例如 "
"AVTZ:AVQZ:AV5Z。某些外推类型需要三个或更多基组，而其他类型仅需两个。默认使用相关能的 :math:`n^{-3}` "
"外推，在这种情况下需要两个连续的基组及其对应的能量。默认不对参考（HF）能量进行外推；使用最大基组获得的值将作为 CBS "
"估计的参考能量。然而，也可以通过指定 ``METHOD_R`` 选项对参考能量进行外推。"

msgid ""
"This will perform the first calculation with AVTZ basis, and then compute "
"the estimated basis set limit using the AVQZ and AV5Z basis sets. The "
"correlation energy obtained in the calculation that is performed immediately"
" before the extrapolate command will be extrapolated (in this case the "
"CCSD(T) energy), and the necessary sequence of calculations [here "
"HF;CCSD(T)] will be automatically carried out. Unless otherwise specified "
"(see below), the Hartree-Fock energy is taken from the largest basis set and"
" not extrapolated."
msgstr ""
"这将首先使用 AVTZ 基组进行计算，然后使用 AVQZ 和 AV5Z "
"基组计算估计的基组极限。紧接在外推命令之前执行的计算中获得的相关能将被外推（在此例中为 CCSD(T) 能量），并且将自动执行必要的计算序列[此处为 "
"HF;CCSD(T)]。除非另有指定（见下文），Hartree-Fock 能量取自最大基组且不外推。"

msgid ""
"The resulting energies are returned in variables ENERGR (reference "
"energies), ENERGY (total energies), and ENERGD (Davidson corrected energy if"
" available); the corresponding basis sets are returned in variable "
"BASISSETS. The results can be printed, e.g., in a table as shown above, or "
"used otherwise. The above input produces the table"
msgstr ""
"得到的能量将返回到变量 ENERGR（参考能量）、ENERGY（总能量）和 ENERGD（如果可用，则为 Davidson "
"校正能量）中；相应的基组返回到变量 BASISSETS 中。结果可以打印，例如，如上所示的表格中，或以其他方式使用。上述输入产生表格"

