"The extrapolated total energy is also returned in variable ECBS (ECBSD for "
"Davidson corrected energy if available)."
msgstr "外推的总能量也返回到变量 ECBS 中（如果可用，Davidson 校正能量则为 ECBSD）。"

msgid ""
"In order to extrapolate the HF energy as well (for example using Karton-"
"Martin extrapolation), one can modify the input as follows:"
msgstr "为了同时外推HF能量（例如使用Karton-Martin外推法），可以按如下方式修改输入："

